repository-code: https://github.com/<your-account>/<your-repo>
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for a study of redundancy against an attacker whose identification cost falls as
  it accumulates similarity-weighted knowledge of the components already removed. Computes the price
  per unit of capability, the saturation of effective redundancy, the design threshold between adding
  a backup and moving a signature, and the value of information about the attacker parameters.
